# HDU 1011 Starship Troopers（星河战队）题解

**题目来源**：HDU http://acm.hdu.edu.cn/showproblem.php?pid=1011

**算法类型**：树形DP / 树形背包

**通过率**：Total Submission(s): 6816 &nbsp; Accepted Submission(s): 1845

## 题目信息

**Time Limit**: 10000/5000 MS (Java/Others)

